  "body_text": "Hello all,\n\nPer the below email from Giles, I am interpreting it as a formal approval and moving forward with production.\n\nThank you\n\nManny\n\nFrom: Purchasing - Sesame Access <purchasing@sesameaccess.com>\nSent: Tuesday, September 22, 2026 1:41 AM\nTo: Karol Porwol <karolp@sesameaccess.com>; Ryam Magpantay <rmagpantay@weberpg.com>; 'JEFF JOHNSON' <jfjsales@cox.net>; Andy Easton <andye@sesameaccess.com>; Steven Lyons <stevenl@sesameaccess.com>\nCc: 'Manny Estrada' <mestrada@weberpg.com>; 'Vanessa' <vanessaB@weberpg.com>\nSubject: Re: Proof for 1591-7003-G-013 rev-0\n\nThanks Jeff, and Karol for confirming art work.\n\nThis order has been placed for the urgent 3 off custom membrane.\n\nThe PO for this has been issued using PO 21574-1591 against quote reference SQR-46632\n\nMany Thanks,\n\nGiles\n\nPurchasing Manager\n\nSesame Access Systems Ltd\n\nUnit 1, Cumberland Works\n\nWintersells Business Park\n\nWest Byfleet\n\nSurrey\n\nUnited Kingdom\n\nKT14 7LF\n\nOffice: 01784 440088\n\nDIRECT LINE : 01784 904484\n\nEmail: purchasing@sesameaccess.com\n\nWeb: www.sesameaccess.com\n\nYouTube: www.youtube.com/sesameaccess\n\nFrom: Karol Porwol <karolp@sesameaccess.com>\nSent: 22 September 2026 08:14\nTo: Ryam Magpantay <rmagpantay@weberpg.com>; 'JEFF JOHNSON' <jfjsales@cox.net>; Purchasing - Sesame Access <purchasing@sesameaccess.com>; Andy Easton <andye@sesameaccess.com>; Steven Lyons <stevenl@sesameaccess.com>\nCc: 'Manny Estrada' <mestrada@weberpg.com>; 'Vanessa' <vanessaB@weberpg.com>\nSubject: Re: Proof for 1591-7003-G-013 rev-0\n\nHi All,\n\nThe drawings provided meet our expectations in terms of both size and design.\n\nPlease note that this should not be considered formal approval. My colleagues, Giles and/or Steven Lyons, will provide the official order confirmation in due course.\n\nKarol Porwol MEng (Hons), BEng.\n\nSesame Access Systems Ltd\n\nUnit 1, Cumberland Works\n\nWintersells Business Park\n\nWest Byfleet\n\nKT14 7LF - Surrey\n\nUnited Kingdom\n\nOffice: 01784 440088\n\nEmail: karolp@sesameaccess.com\n\nWeb: www.sesameaccess.com\n\nYouTube: www.youtube.com/sesameaccess\n\nFrom: Ryam Magpantay <rmagpantay@weberpg.com>\nSent: 21 September 2026 20:45\nTo: 'JEFF JOHNSON' <jfjsales@cox.net>; Purchasing - Sesame Access <purchasing@sesameaccess.com>; Andy Easton <andye@sesameaccess.com>; Karol Porwol <karolp@sesameaccess.com>; Steven Lyons <stevenl@sesameaccess.com>\nCc: 'Manny Estrada' <mestrada@weberpg.com>; 'Vanessa' <vanessaB@weberpg.com>\nSubject: Proof for 1591-7003-G-013 rev-0\n\nGood morning,\n\nHere is the switch proof for 1591-7003-G-0013 REV-0.\n\nPlease review all dimensions.\n\nIf the proof meets your approval, please sign it and email it back to me with your confirmation.\n\nIf you have any other questions or concerns, please let us know.\n\nRegards,\n\nRyam Magpantay\nART DIRECTOR/MEMBRANE DESIGN ENGINEER\nWeber Precision Graphics\n714.556.6222 ext.223\nRmagpantay@weberpg.com\n\nFrom: JEFF JOHNSON <jfjsales@cox.net>\nSent: Friday, September 18, 2026 5:52 PM\nTo: Giles <purchasing@sesameaccess.com>; Andy Easton <andye@sesameaccess.com>; Karol Porwol <karolp@sesameaccess.com>; Steven Lyons <stevenl@sesameaccess.com>\nCc: Manny Estrada <mestrada@weberpg.com>; Vanessa <vanessaB@weberpg.com>; Ryam Magpantay <rmagpantay@weberpg.com>\nSubject: Update for PO 21574-1591\n\nHello Gentlemen,\n\nWe are still waiting to receive some of the custom size material and we hope to receive by the end of next week. We believe we will be able ship by Oct. 9, but we hope we can improve this as we get closer.\n\nPlease be on the lookout for the artwork that will be sent to you for your review and approval - you should receive this by mid-next week.\n\nRegards,\n\nJeff @ Weber",
